    "triple-line": {
      "_comment": [
        "D5/D8: the gate. Subject is lazy and may be empty (continuation lines).",
        "The operator alternation puts QUAD before DD at the SAME position, so '.. ..' is one",
        "token while an earlier typed '..' still wins on position (leftmost-first).",
        "Object is lazy with an optional trailing meta group, so it stops at a CM2 but",
        "otherwise runs to end of line (corpus case 20: an object may contain '..')."
      ],
      "match": "^[ \\t]*([^\\r\\n]*?)[ \\t]*(?:((?<!\\.)(?:\\.{4}|\\.{2}[ \\t]+\\.{2})(?!\\.))|((?<!\\.)\\.{2}(?!\\.))[ \\t]*([^\\r\\n]*?)[ \\t]*((?<!\\.)\\.{2}(?!\\.)))[ \\t]*([^\\r\\n]*?)(?:[ \\t]*((?<!,),,(?!,))([^\\r\\n]*))?[ \\t]*$",
      "captures": {
        "1": {
          "name": "entity.name.subject.ddot",
          "patterns": [
